OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPatchy rain
OL,6,Fwill affect central, northern and
OL,7,Fwestern areas this evening, with more
OL,8,Fpersistent and locally heavier rain
OL,9,Fmoving in from the west overnight.
OL,10,FClearer for a time in the northeast,
OL,11,Fand little rain in the southeast.
OL,12,FBreezy, but mild.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSunday:FSunday will start rather
OL,15,Fcloudy and breezy with some showery
OL,16,Frain. Showers more scattered in the
OL,17,Fafternoon, with some warm sunshine
OL,18,Fdeveloping. Not much rain in the south
OL,19,Fand southeast.
